`,(0,n.jsx)(r.p,{children:"What Claude gives you back is mostly determined by what you let it read. One more connected source usually improves the deck more than another rewrite of the prompt, so spend your setup time on access to the channels where the quarter was discussed, the folder with the finance report, and the dashboards you want checked."}),`
